  "editorial_title": "MARKET COMMENTARY:",
  "nutshell": [
    "- ECB, Fed, and BoE all left their key rates unchanged.",
    "- (page 1)",
    "- The completion of Evergrande’s pre-sold homes by Chi-",
    "- nese Government may  support ongoing demand for",
    "- commodities (page 1)",
    "- Dry bulk S&P activity in 2024 almost double compared",
